   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EUSR Outreach fas 2/2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EUSR vill st&#xF6;dja det civila samh&#xE4;llet i Bosnien och Hercegovina i att f&#xF6;respr&#xE5;ka f&#xF6;r fullg&#xF6;randet av sina egna rekommendationer, i linje med stabiliserings-och anslutningsavtalet, som m&#xE5;ste genomf&#xF6;ras f&#xF6;r att Bosnien och Hercegovina att forts&#xE4;tta med  EU-integrationsprocessen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EUSR wishes to support civic society in Bosnia and Herzegovina in advocating for the fulfilment of their own recommendations, in line with the Stabilisation and Accession Agreement, that have to be implemented in order for BiH to continue with the EU integration process.</narrative>
  </description>
